{"parentUuid":"59176752-9e78-41c7-a1d9-9c688707869b","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1/ios/RheaApp","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AtNGMf8MgCUg9mGgdU2rFj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying two things:\n1. \"до сих пор нет инструмента общего диалога\" — \"there's still no general dialog tool\" — referring to the human research UI / composer-first research surface that's been pending\n2. \"и не testflight\" — \"and no testflight\" — the build still hasn't appeared in TestFlight\n\nLet me check App Store Connect status for the build, and also think about what \"инструмент общего диалога\" means in context.\n\nLooking at the session history, the user has repeatedly mentioned \"nobody tried the UI for human task\" — a composer-first research surface. \n\nSo the core issue is that the app currently has Radio, Atlas, Governor, Tasks, and Settings, but there's no direct chat interface where humans can actually interact with the system and conduct research. I need to check TestFlight status and then prioritize building this dialog tool since the user is clearly frustrated with these delays.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":338,"cache_read_input_tokens":126204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":338},"output_tokens":13,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYadL6Nt26uwmoPpaup3Q","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a7963ce-a4e2-45c7-94c1-c530f35bd880","timestamp":"2026-02-28T14:30:23.689Z"}
