{"parentUuid":"16854884-3772-46f3-a351-ec4cb94ee644","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1/ios/RheaApp","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018nynmXy893xqKNBdqKiu96","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Done. Both deliverables:**\n\n1. **Dialog tab** — new `DialogView.swift`, first tab in the app. Agent picker (shared/rex/orion/gemini/hyperion), chat bubbles, sends via `/office/send`, polls `/chat` history. Running in simulator now.\n\n2. **TestFlight build 1.0 (5)** — uploaded to App Store Connect, processing. Includes Dialog tab + all icon/orientation fixes. Should appear in TestFlight within ~10-15 minutes.\n\nTo actually receive TestFlight builds on your phone, go to **App Store Connect → TestFlight → Internal Testing** → create a group → add your Apple ID → select build 5.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe system calendar is Islamic (Hijri 1447), which makes `xcodebuild` create archives in `~/Library/Developer/Xcode/Archives/1447-09-11/` instead of `2026-02-28/`. This broke all my hardcoded Gregorian date paths. The fix: always use `ls -dt *.xcarchive | head -1` to find the latest archive instead of constructing the path manually.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":753,"cache_read_input_tokens":143239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":753},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYae2xDPajT9v11LVqXb8","type":"assistant","uuid":"afcdb8fc-4131-4b14-9f14-b8602d3a2497","timestamp":"2026-02-28T14:39:44.149Z"}
