{"parentUuid":"edfbef30-fbbc-496d-8cb7-79a20231bb31","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016Rf8qrxjDxMzamCmYNYqoP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good research. Here's the practical picture:\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n**Play is shutting down April 20, 2026** — less than 2 months. You're right to maximize it NOW. Two export modes: **Code Panel** (copy-paste, no interactions) vs **Play to Xcode SDK** (full package with PlaySDK — keeps animations, interactions, state). The SDK is the one to use.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nLet me check if PlaySDK integrates into our project structure."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1398,"cache_read_input_tokens":86725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1398},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYai8uJQRdfQwLAmeDsD2","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b11ab45-50b2-4eeb-954d-30193fa24255","timestamp":"2026-02-28T15:33:26.486Z"}
