{"parentUuid":"b0aec247-2107-42d0-bbbc-eb2e22ea20a4","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01995VhW1xW53evzukqpSHPi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Our project already uses Pow (animation library from EmergeTools). We can add PlaySDK as another dependency.\n\nLet me check the PlaySDK GitHub repo to see what the correct package URL and version are.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":88123,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":755},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYai9yYvEKEv8PUxsiM5J","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a62f9af-f56a-4f85-b106-ba5e81f7b3dd","timestamp":"2026-02-28T15:33:33.496Z"}
{"parentUuid":"9a62f9af-f56a-4f85-b106-ba5e81f7b3dd","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01995VhW1xW53evzukqpSHPi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our project uses Swift 5.9, iOS 17+, already has Pow for animations. PlaySDK slots in as another dependency.\n\nHere's the strategy:\n\n**What you do in Play (design side):**\n1. Open \"Mika's Team\" project\n2. Design the 4 key screens: **Dialog**, **Governor cards**, **Pulse**, **Radio**\n3. Use Play's components for cards, lists, input bars, status indicators\n4. Export via **Play to Xcode** (not copy-paste) → generates SwiftUI package\n\n**What I do (code side):**\n1. Add PlaySDK to `Package.swift` as dependency\n2. Import Play-designed views into our Sources\n3. Wire data/networking into the Play-exported shells\n4. Replace my hand-coded views with your designed ones\n\n**Immediate integration** — I'll add PlaySDK to our dependencies now so it's ready when you export:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":88123,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":755},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYai9yYvEKEv8PUxsiM5J","type":"assistant","uuid":"f8612808-7bbe-4fd8-9ee4-a12aeb82e40c","timestamp":"2026-02-28T15:33:38.979Z"}
