{"parentUuid":"2ae41669-1978-4a29-9af8-70face757f4f","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01T3Psgs2qhVnbWfXZC4pk3W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Key findings:\n\n1. **PlaySDK is essentially empty** — it's just a wrapper with a single file `Sources/PlaySDKWrapper/export.swift` (27 bytes!). The actual UI components come from Play.app's export process, not from the SDK itself. The SDK is just a bridge/wrapper that Play exports target. The real value is in what Play GENERATES when you export, not what's in the SDK repo.\n\n2. **PlaySDK has NO LICENSE** — can't legally fork and redistribute.\n\n3. **Best legal options:**\n   - `jordansinger/SwiftUI-Kit` — 2514 stars, MIT license — SwiftUI system components demo\n   - `playbook-ui/playbook-ios` — 1219 stars, Apache-2.0 — snapshot testing framework\n   - `SimformSolutionsPvtLtd/SSNeumorphicKit` — 69 stars, MIT — neumorphic design components\n\nThe real insight: PlaySDK is just a 27-byte export wrapper. The actual UI comes from Play.app's export — which generates standard SwiftUI code. That generated code has no license restrictions since it's YOUR design exported as code. So the strategy is to use Play.app to design screens and export as SwiftUI code directly, bypassing the SDK entirely.\n\nFor a reusable \"Rhea Plus UI\" library, I'd build our own component library using the design patterns from the exported code and supplement it with MIT-licensed SwiftUI component libraries. Let me search for more substantial SwiftUI design system libraries.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2160,"cache_read_input_tokens":97443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2160},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYajzmMBH6BmP8Fw4SkCg","type":"assistant","uuid":"bb019e18-c3a4-4f87-a14a-ec06040f6760","timestamp":"2026-02-28T15:57:50.720Z"}
