{"parentUuid":"0b2284db-8557-4a00-acd7-99c705058d80","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NixBnUGVcHDYZHgzsk8zTf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the screen! Key observations:\n\n1. **iPhone Mirroring window is open** — it shows \"iPhone in Use\" with message \"Lock your iPhone to connect. iPhone Mirroring will connect when iPhone is no longer in use.\"\n2. The user's iPhone is currently being used (unlocked), so iPhone Mirroring can't connect yet\n3. I can see the Claude Code terminal in the background\n4. There's also a \"RHEA FLOW\" widget in the top right showing \"recovering score=76 openD state=t3\"\n\nThe system works — I can see the screen, I can click with cliclick, and I can read screenshots. \n\nSo the next step is straightforward: the user needs to lock their iPhone so the mirroring connection can establish, and then I'll be able to see and interact with the phone screen.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":164772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYapUrErbD8fwjiJLkyaV","type":"assistant","uuid":"344b9b40-d32c-4a85-aa70-f238940a6324","timestamp":"2026-02-28T16:56:38.009Z"}
{"parentUuid":"344b9b40-d32c-4a85-aa70-f238940a6324","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NixBnUGVcHDYZHgzsk8zTf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Вижу экран. iPhone Mirroring открыт, но говорит **\"iPhone in Use — Lock your iPhone to connect\"**. Телефон надо заблокировать — тогда зеркало подключится и я получу контроль.\n\nПолная цепочка уже работает:\n- `screencapture` → снимок экрана ✅\n- `Read` → я вижу что на экране ✅  \n- `cliclick c:X,Y` → клик в нужной точке ✅\n- iPhone Mirroring → клики передаются на телефон (нужно заблокировать)\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nМост готов: `screencapture` → AI анализирует → `cliclick` кликает → iPhone Mirroring передаёт тап на телефон. Это даёт полный remote control над любым приложением на iPhone через Mac, без jailbreak, без специальных entitlements. Единственное условие: телефон заблокирован + Mirroring активен.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nЗакоммичу и пушну всё что сделали — Pilot view + endpoints + screen_pilot.sh:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":164772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYapUrErbD8fwjiJLkyaV","type":"assistant","uuid":"496341b1-cda1-42ee-b906-0d6553eb4640","timestamp":"2026-02-28T16:56:44.976Z"}
