{"parentUuid":"5da4b117-2c16-4a7d-b2c9-1596ee5dbf44","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013ChVQWaWzNoQ5Q6ML9Stus","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good news — the plan is **already fully implemented**:\n\n1. `/agents/status` — backend endpoint complete (tribunal_api.py:2234-2324)\n2. `GovernorView.swift` — fetches from `/agents/status` with full enrichment\n3. `PulseMonitorView.swift` — fetches from `/agents/status` for agent data\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nBoth iOS views decode the unified response but with different models (`AgentStatus` vs `PulseAgentDTO`). Governor uses `Charts` + `Pow` for animations, Pulse uses simpler HStack layouts. The Governor's blank white screen on device is likely one of: (a) old TestFlight build without this code, (b) API unreachable from phone (HTTP vs HTTPS / ATS), or (c) JSON decode mismatch.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nLet me check if the server is actually reachable and responding correctly."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10583,"cache_read_input_tokens":73172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10583},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYaqYre9JYNmevgiQE39a","type":"assistant","uuid":"838c164f-f9c4-40eb-9e06-d67d098e77c2","timestamp":"2026-02-28T17:10:45.808Z"}
