{"parentUuid":"3e29d5bf-f7b4-4e34-a9a6-69a8019b3d74","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018wzCgDqAArNdg7RTNLY4sN","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","data":"","media_type":"image/jpeg"}}]}]},"uuid":"51583cf8-4c43-4fd5-a402-b82cc4bea5e8","timestamp":"2026-02-28T17:11:27.121Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"image","file":{"base64":"","type":"image/jpeg","originalSize":3894524}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3e29d5bf-f7b4-4e34-a9a6-69a8019b3d74"}
{"parentUuid":"51583cf8-4c43-4fd5-a402-b82cc4bea5e8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0137FaN4S2pxfiUnqnH4xHkn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the iPhone Mirroring window is still showing \"Unlock Your iPhone\" or similar - actually wait, looking more carefully, the iPhone Mirroring window seems to still be showing the same \"Unlock Your iPhone\" dialog. But the actual phone (visible on the right side of the image) is clearly unlocked showing the home screen with the statue wallpaper.\n\nThe issue is that iPhone Mirroring requires the phone to be LOCKED (not in use) for mirroring to work. When the phone is being actively used (unlocked), mirroring can't connect. The user needs to LOCK the phone (press the side button to put it to sleep), then mirroring will connect.\n\n\nSo I need to tell them to lock their iPhone by pressing the side button - that's the actual requirement for mirroring to establish a connection.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":87378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYaqdZkHSQC34ZbQmkLXt","type":"assistant","uuid":"7a5f1842-52ac-463b-8049-595d6175243e","timestamp":"2026-02-28T17:11:43.494Z"}
{"parentUuid":"7a5f1842-52ac-463b-8049-595d6175243e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0137FaN4S2pxfiUnqnH4xHkn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"iPhone Mirroring still can't connect — the phone is **unlocked and in use**, which is the blocker. iPhone Mirroring requires the opposite:\n\n**Lock your phone** (press the side button to turn the screen off). Mirroring only works when the iPhone is locked/sleeping — it takes over the display remotely. While you're actively using the phone, macOS can't mirror it.\n\nOnce you lock it, I'll detect the connection and navigate to Play.app.\n\nMeanwhile — the server is healthy and `/agents/status` returns full data. The **Governor white screen** issue on TestFlight is because the current TestFlight build predates the GovernorView rewrite to use `/agents/status`. A new archive + upload would fix all three tabs (Governor, Pulse, Dialog).\n\nAlso noticed Orion is running in parallel (`gpt-5.3-codex xhigh · 62% left`) — the Radio widget on the phone is live and pulling real data. The system is working."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":87378,"output_tokens":529,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":430,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYaqdZkHSQC34ZbQmkLXt","type":"assistant","uuid":"df2e2c98-b5cd-4b0e-a93d-b0d2098ee3df","timestamp":"2026-02-28T17:11:47.834Z"}
