{"parentUuid":"1506ef80-dd09-45c5-9051-f6ac79072bf8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SxodB76Rt2k7QeeVDM2Thx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The .env file either doesn't exist or has no other API keys. Only GEMINI_API_KEY is available and it's expired. The Dialog, Governor, and other API-dependent features won't work without a valid key.\n\nLet me focus on what I CAN do productively:1. The Governor white screen on TestFlight — this might not be an API key issue but rather a decoding issue. Let me check the `AgentStatus` model for potential decode failures.2. Save the Play data extraction findings3. Commit progress and push\n\nFor the Governor white screen: the iOS app is calling `/agents/status` which returns JSON. If ANY field fails to decode (e.g., a `null` where the model expects a non-optional), the whole view shows blank. \n\nNow I'm examining the actual `/agents/status` response for agent \"A1\" to see if there are any fields that might cause decoding failures.\n\nComparing the JSON response with the Swift `AgentStatus` model definition... The JSONDecoder should handle the missing fields fine since it ignores unknown keys by default, and `last_activity` as a string maps correctly whether it's a timestamp or null. I'm realizing the actual problem might be that the Governor tab appeared blank on the user's device—possibly because the TestFlight build is outdated compared to what they're expecting.\n\nSince the app is clearly running (the Dialog and Radio tabs work), the blank Governor tab points to a runtime issue, most likely App Transport Security blocking an HTTP connection to the API instead of HTTPS. I need to check what `AppConfig.defaultAPIBaseURL` is actually set to.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":207,"cache_read_input_tokens":135149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":207},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYatCffPLtiaXZukN4jA4","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d1aba61-39d7-4afe-9a0c-db2498afa365","timestamp":"2026-02-28T17:45:39.613Z"}
