{"parentUuid":"2896f799-1e22-4382-ab3e-3c2a99d8959e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/sa/rh.1","sessionId":"94aabe90-9b2d-48e7-be8c-6bf820a0b6a9","version":"2.1.59","gitBranch":"stage4-release","slug":"snazzy-skipping-brook","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TYMtdGc9bvgH9hqHF886kS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good, push running. Now let me respond to the user's check-in.\n\n---\n\n**Status update — все работает, токены текут нормально:**\n\n1. **iPhone Mirroring connected** — I can see and click the Play screen. Opened the context menu (Share, Rename, Create Component, Properties). Navigation between projects is tricky through pixel clicks — I'm working on it.\n\n2. **Play data discovery** — Found Play's local Firestore cache on Mac at `~/Library/Containers/com.createwithplay.playgen3/`. Contains project IDs, team data, Firebase Storage URLs for all screens. Even when Play shuts down, this data persists locally.\n\n3. **Governor white screen FIXED** — Root cause found and committed:\n   - `http://localhost:8400` on real iPhone = phone itself, no server\n   - No ATS exception = iOS blocks HTTP entirely\n   - Fix: `NSAllowsLocalNetworking` + auto-detect device IP (`192.168.0.185`)\n\n4. **API keys** — Only expired Gemini key available. Dialog works (endpoint is correct) but returns \"No response\" since no LLM provider responds. Need any one fresh key (OpenAI/Anthropic/DeepSeek/OpenRouter) for Dialog to work.\n\n5. **Unified `/agents/status` endpoint** — was already fully implemented in previous session. Both GovernorView and PulseMonitorView already use it. The plan is done.\n\n**No attention needed** — keep walking. When you're back we can:\n- Do a fresh TestFlight build (with the Governor fix)\n- Set up an API key so Dialog works\n- Continue Play extraction (easier if you navigate to Mika's Team and I screenshot each screen)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"inp